cility_id":"110056537804","distance_km":5.7,"bearing_deg":215.3,"in_corridor":null,"resolution":"not traced: wind too light to trace (2.4 mph)"},{"incident":"446778","entity":"SJRR Power Peaking Facility","rn":"RN110723897","start_local":"2025-09-26T12:01","compound":"NH3","pounds":2.0,"facility_id":"110071241256","distance_km":13.1,"bearing_deg":348.3,"in_corridor":null,"resolution":"not traced: wind too light to trace (2.4 mph)"}],"search_scope":"Searched every STEERS emissions event starting 09/28/2025 in Harris County (1 found; search complete). Also searched reports that started in the 30 days before and were still running (2 open that day; earlier search complete). The match window runs past midnight, so reports that started 09/29/2025 by 01:00 local were also searched (0 found; search complete). Wind too light to trace (2.4 mph): no corridor drawn, so the search is incomplete. A report open at that time could not be located, so the search is incomplete.","status":"search_incomplete","incident":null,"matched_facility_id":null,"source_url":"https://www2.tceq.texas.gov/oce/eer/","checks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"search_incomplete","note":"wind too light to trace (2.4 mph)"},{"at":"T+14d","status":"search_incomplete","note":"wind too light to trace (2.4 mph)"}],"reported":null},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_1015","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[131.0,271.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On September 28, 2025, the Texas state monitor at Lynchburg Ferry recorded 10.97 ppb of benzene in the 10:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.23 ppb. Wind there came from 271 degrees at 2.4 mph. The wind was too light to trace where the air came from, so no upwind corridor is drawn. No matching report was found in the records checked; the search is incomplete. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility near the monitor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 28 de septiembre de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en Lynchburg Ferry registró 10.97 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 10:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.23 ppb. El viento venía de 271 grados a 2.4 mph. El viento era demasiado débil para saber de dónde venía el aire, así que no se traza un corredor. No se encontró un reporte que coincida en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación cercana al monitor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0069_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87507,"sha256":"32c6191a68a6eb169dd6e26d6775c5854ffb61f4502a4db47a3543dc085967c3","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:43+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88633,"sha256":"fdb894876a95d29142128960f5003a95868a7